{"questions":[{"question_id":"lsbm5rqa","content":"In Kjeldahl's method for estimation of nitrogen, <mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.339ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"6.897ex\" height=\"1.934ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -705 3048.6 855\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"msub\"><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"43\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-43\"></use><use data-c=\"75\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-75\" transform=\"translate(722,0)\"></use><use data-c=\"53\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-53\" transform=\"translate(1278,0)\"></use><use data-c=\"4F\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-4F\" transform=\"translate(1834,0)\"></use></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(2645,-150) scale(0.707)\"><use data-c=\"34\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-34\"></use></g></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container> acts as :","chapter":"practical-organic-chemistry","chapterGroup":"organic-chemistry","country":"in","difficulty":"easy","exam":"jee-main","examGroup":"jee","isBonus":false,"isOutOfSyllabus":false,"languages":["en","hi"],"marks":4,"negMarks":1,"paperId":"jee-main-2024-online-1st-february-morning-shift","paperTitle":"JEE Main 2024 (Online) 1st February Morning Shift","permalink":"in-kjeldahls-method-for-estimation-of-nitrogen-mathrmcu-jee-main-chemistry-i85i5xvzpkbumyah","question":{"en":{"comprehension":null,"direction":null,"content":"In Kjeldahl's method for estimation of nitrogen, <mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.339ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"6.897ex\" height=\"1.934ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -705 3048.6 855\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"msub\"><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"43\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-43\"></use><use data-c=\"75\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-75\" transform=\"translate(722,0)\"></use><use data-c=\"53\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-53\" transform=\"translate(1278,0)\"></use><use data-c=\"4F\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-4F\" transform=\"translate(1834,0)\"></use></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(2645,-150) scale(0.707)\"><use data-c=\"34\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-34\"></use></g></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container> acts as :","options":[{"identifier":"A","content":"catalytic agent"},{"identifier":"B","content":"hydrolysis agent"},{"identifier":"C","content":"reducing agent"},{"identifier":"D","content":"oxidising agent"}],"correct_options":["A"],"answer":null,"explanation":"<p>The correct option here is :</p>\n<p><strong>Option A : catalytic agent</strong></p>\n\n<p>In the Kjeldahl method for the estimation of nitrogen, <mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.339ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"6.897ex\" height=\"1.934ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -705 3048.6 855\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"msub\"><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"43\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-43\"></use><use data-c=\"75\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-75\" transform=\"translate(722,0)\"></use><use data-c=\"53\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-53\" transform=\"translate(1278,0)\"></use><use data-c=\"4F\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-4F\" transform=\"translate(1834,0)\"></use></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(2645,-150) scale(0.707)\"><use data-c=\"34\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-34\"></use></g></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container> or copper sulfate acts as a catalytic agent. The method consists of three main steps: digestion, neutralization, and titration. During the digestion phase, the organic substance containing nitrogen is heated with concentrated sulfuric acid (<mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.339ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"6.69ex\" height=\"1.934ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -705 2957.1 855\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><g data-mml-node=\"msub\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"48\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-48\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(783,-150) scale(0.707)\"><use data-c=\"32\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-32\"></use></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"msub\" transform=\"translate(1186.6,0)\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"53\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-53\"></use><use data-c=\"4F\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-4F\" transform=\"translate(556,0)\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(1367,-150) scale(0.707)\"><use data-c=\"34\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-34\"></use></g></g></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container>), which digests or breaks down the organic matrix, releasing the nitrogen in the form of ammonium sulfate (<mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.566ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"11.135ex\" height=\"2.262ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -750 4921.7 1000\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><g data-mml-node=\"mo\"><use data-c=\"28\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-28\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"msub\" transform=\"translate(389,0)\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"4E\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-4E\"></use><use data-c=\"48\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-48\" transform=\"translate(750,0)\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(1533,-150) scale(0.707)\"><use data-c=\"34\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-34\"></use></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"msub\" transform=\"translate(2325.6,0)\"><g data-mml-node=\"mo\"><use data-c=\"29\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-29\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(422,-150) scale(0.707)\"><use data-c=\"32\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-32\"></use></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"msub\" transform=\"translate(3151.1,0)\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"53\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-53\"></use><use data-c=\"4F\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-4F\" transform=\"translate(556,0)\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(1367,-150) scale(0.707)\"><use data-c=\"34\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-34\"></use></g></g></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container>).</p>\n\n<p>Organic compound <mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.646ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"27.052ex\" height=\"3.225ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -1140.3 11957 1425.6\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"mo\"><use data-c=\"2B\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-2B\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"msub\" transform=\"translate(778,0)\"><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"48\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-48\"></use></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(783,-150) scale(0.707)\"><use data-c=\"32\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-32\"></use></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"msub\" transform=\"translate(1964.6,0)\"><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"53\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-53\"></use><use data-c=\"4F\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-4F\" transform=\"translate(556,0)\"></use></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(1367,-150) scale(0.707)\"><use data-c=\"34\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-34\"></use></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" data-mjx-texclass=\"REL\" transform=\"translate(4012.9,0)\"><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" data-mjx-texclass=\"undefined\"></g><g data-mml-node=\"mover\"><g data-mml-node=\"mo\"><use data-c=\"2192\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-SO-2192\" transform=\"translate(1854.7,0)\"></use><svg width=\"1924.7\" height=\"180\" x=\"0\" y=\"160\" viewBox=\"481.2 160 1924.7 180\"><use data-c=\"2190\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-SO-2190\" transform=\"scale(4.733,1)\"></use></svg></g><g data-mml-node=\"mpadded\" transform=\"translate(0,683.2) scale(0.707)\"><g transform=\"translate(278,-200)\"><g data-mml-node=\"msub\"><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"43\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-43\"></use><use data-c=\"75\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-75\" transform=\"translate(722,0)\"></use><use data-c=\"53\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-53\" transform=\"translate(1278,0)\"></use><use data-c=\"4F\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-4F\" transform=\"translate(1834,0)\"></use></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(2645,-150) scale(0.707)\"><use data-c=\"34\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-34\"></use></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"mspace\" transform=\"translate(3048.6,0)\"></g></g></g></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"msub\" transform=\"translate(7035.3,0)\"><g data-mml-node=\"mrow\"><g data-mml-node=\"mo\"><use data-c=\"28\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-28\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"msub\" transform=\"translate(389,0)\"><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"4E\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-4E\"></use><use data-c=\"48\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-48\" transform=\"translate(750,0)\"></use></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(1533,-150) scale(0.707)\"><use data-c=\"34\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-34\"></use></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(2325.6,0)\"><use data-c=\"29\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-29\"></use></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(2747.6,-285.4) scale(0.707)\"><use data-c=\"32\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-32\"></use></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"msub\" transform=\"translate(10186.4,0)\"><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"53\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-53\"></use><use data-c=\"4F\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-4F\" transform=\"translate(556,0)\"></use></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(1367,-150) scale(0.707)\"><use data-c=\"34\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-34\"></use></g></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container></p>\n\n<p>Catalysts such as <mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.339ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"6.897ex\" height=\"1.934ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -705 3048.6 855\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"msub\"><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"43\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-43\"></use><use data-c=\"75\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-75\" transform=\"translate(722,0)\"></use><use data-c=\"53\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-53\" transform=\"translate(1278,0)\"></use><use data-c=\"4F\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-4F\" transform=\"translate(1834,0)\"></use></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(2645,-150) scale(0.707)\"><use data-c=\"34\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-34\"></use></g></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container>, along with other salts like potassium sulfate (<mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.339ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"6.754ex\" height=\"1.934ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -705 2985.1 855\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><g data-mml-node=\"msub\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"4B\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-4B\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(811,-150) scale(0.707)\"><use data-c=\"32\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-32\"></use></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"msub\" transform=\"translate(1214.6,0)\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"53\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-53\"></use><use data-c=\"4F\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-4F\" transform=\"translate(556,0)\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(1367,-150) scale(0.707)\"><use data-c=\"34\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-34\"></use></g></g></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container>), are added to the reaction mixture to raise the boiling point of the sulfuric acid and to accelerate the oxidation of the organic material. This increases the rate of the digestion process, ensuring that the nitrogen within the sample is fully converted to ammonium ions (<mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.339ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"5.814ex\" height=\"2.2ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -822.3 2569.7 972.3\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"msup\"><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><g data-mml-node=\"msub\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"4E\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-4E\"></use><use data-c=\"48\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-48\" transform=\"translate(750,0)\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(1533,-150) scale(0.707)\"><use data-c=\"34\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-34\"></use></g></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(1969.6,410.1) scale(0.707)\"><use data-c=\"2B\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-2B\"></use></g></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container>). The catalyst itself is not consumed in the reaction and does not become a part of the product; its role is to increase the reaction rate. After digestion, the mixture is neutralized with a base, and then the liberated ammonia is distilled off and quantitatively measured, typically by titration with a standard acid solution.</p>\n\n<p>Therefore, <mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.339ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"6.897ex\" height=\"1.934ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -705 3048.6 855\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"msub\"><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"43\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-43\"></use><use data-c=\"75\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-75\" transform=\"translate(722,0)\"></use><use data-c=\"53\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-53\" transform=\"translate(1278,0)\"></use><use data-c=\"4F\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-4F\" transform=\"translate(1834,0)\"></use></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(2645,-150) scale(0.707)\"><use data-c=\"34\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-34\"></use></g></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container> serves as a catalyst in this chemical analysis technique for quantitatively determining the nitrogen content of organic substances.</p>"},"hi":{"comprehension":null,"direction":null,"content":"नाइट्रोजन के आँकलन की कजल्डाहल पद्धति में <mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.339ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"6.897ex\" height=\"1.934ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -705 3048.6 855\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"msub\"><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"43\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-43\"></use><use data-c=\"75\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-75\" transform=\"translate(722,0)\"></use><use data-c=\"53\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-53\" transform=\"translate(1278,0)\"></use><use data-c=\"4F\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-4F\" transform=\"translate(1834,0)\"></use></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(2645,-150) scale(0.707)\"><use data-c=\"34\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-34\"></use></g></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container> का प्रयोग किस रूप में होता है :","options":[{"identifier":"A","content":"प्रेरक एजेंट"},{"identifier":"B","content":"ह��इड्रोलिसिस एजेंट"},{"identifier":"C","content":"रिड्यूसिंग एजेंट"},{"identifier":"D","content":"ऑक्सीडाइजिंग एजेंट"}],"correct_options":["A"],"answer":null,"explanation":"<p>यहाँ सही विकल्प है:</p>\n<p><strong>विकल्प A : उत्प्रेरक कारक</strong></p>\n\n<p>नाइट्रोजन के आकलन के लिए Kjeldahl विधि में, <mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.339ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"6.897ex\" height=\"1.934ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -705 3048.6 855\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"msub\"><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"43\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-43\"></use><use data-c=\"75\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-75\" transform=\"translate(722,0)\"></use><use data-c=\"53\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-53\" transform=\"translate(1278,0)\"></use><use data-c=\"4F\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-4F\" transform=\"translate(1834,0)\"></use></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(2645,-150) scale(0.707)\"><use data-c=\"34\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-34\"></use></g></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container> या कॉपर सल्फेट एक उत्प्रेरक कारक के रूप में कार्य करता है। इस विधि में तीन मुख्य चरण होते हैं: पाचन, उदासीनीकरण और अनुमापन। पाचन चरण के दौरान, नाइट्रोजन युक्त कार्बनिक पदार्थ को सांद्र सल्फ्यूरिक अम्ल (<mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.339ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"6.69ex\" height=\"1.934ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -705 2957.1 855\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><g data-mml-node=\"msub\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"48\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-48\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(783,-150) scale(0.707)\"><use data-c=\"32\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-32\"></use></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"msub\" transform=\"translate(1186.6,0)\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"53\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-53\"></use><use data-c=\"4F\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-4F\" transform=\"translate(556,0)\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(1367,-150) scale(0.707)\"><use data-c=\"34\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-34\"></use></g></g></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container>) के साथ गर्म किया जाता है, जो कार्बनिक संरचना को पचाता या विघटित करता है, तथा नाइट्रोजन को अमोनियम सल्फेट (<mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.566ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"11.135ex\" height=\"2.262ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"fal